== 7.10 Chapter 7 Practice Drill — 40 Questions

40 questions graded in the order the CBT engine is likely to meet them. Allow 44 minutes; the key and a full solution for every question follow.

#mcq(1, [A crop that completes its life cycle within one year is],
  [an annual],
  [an ephemeral],
  [a biennial],
  [a perennial]
)

#mcq(2, [A crop that lives for more than two years is],
  [an annual],
  [a perennial],
  [a biennial],
  [a herb]
)

#mcq(3, [Which of these is a cereal?],
  [sorghum],
  [cassava],
  [groundnut],
  [cowpea]
)

#mcq(4, [Which of these is a legume?],
  [cassava],
  [cocoa],
  [millet],
  [cowpea]
)

#mcq(5, [A legume is valued in a rotation because it],
  [fixes atmospheric nitrogen in its root nodules],
  [grows without water],
  [needs no weeding],
  [resists all pests]
)

